  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Based on maui 10.0.14\n\nChanges since 10.0.13\nMerge pull request #79 from budcribar/claude/escape-release-notes\nEscape commas and semicolons in the release notes passed to dotnet pack\nMerge pull request #78 from budcribar/claude/fix-webview-version-test\nExpect WebView 10.0.14 in the module serving version test\nMerge pull request #76 from budcribar/fix/nuget-release-readiness\nMerge pull request #75 from budcribar/claude/remote-component-exit-on-eof\nPrepare NuGet release packaging, CI test coverage, and remote component contract hardening\nRemoteComponentHost: ExitWhenInputCloses, exit when stdin ends instead of polling\nMerge pull request #73 from budcribar/claude/agent-registry-experimental\nMerge pull request #74 from budcribar/claude/mirror-safe-remote-frames\nKeep remote component frames from restarting when the app is mirrored\nMark agent registry (AgentHub/AgentAdmin) experimental (RWV001)\nMerge pull request #72 from budcribar/claude/fix-authorization-build\nBump NuGet packages to latest stable (staying on .NET 10)\nRestore Authorization package references in RemoteWebViewService.Lib\nMerge pull request #70 from budcribar/claude/remote-components-generator\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/net10' into claude/remote-components-generator\nMerge pull request #69 from budcribar/claude/remote-components\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/net10' into claude/remote-components\nMerge pull request #68 from budcribar/claude/remote-blazor-generator\nMerge pull request #71 from budcribar/claude/generic-wording\nDescribe agents and the embedded relay without naming one app\nRemote components README: use a generic contract example\nMerge branch 'claude/remote-components' into claude/remote-components-generator\nRemote components: describe the use generically\nAdd the [RemoteComponentContract] source generator\nAdd remote components: runtime and the WPF RemoteComponentHost\nAdd ReverseMirror to [RemoteBlazor]\nAdd the [RemoteBlazor] source generator\nPort the net9 test-runner and window-sizing fixes.\nInstall nvm-windows when RunTests.ps1 cannot find nvm.\nThrow the frame-ancestor error after the scan.\nName the first invalid frame ancestor after valid ones.\nMerge pull request #67 from budcribar/net10-bugbounty-fixes\nPort Bug02, Bug03 (dispose-on-throw), Bug06, Bug15, Bug44, and Bug60 fixes and regression tests\nSet the net10 packages to 10.0.14 and the current Microsoft 10.0 libraries.\nFix Sonar reliability and security findings that are safe to backport.\nMerge pull request #64 from budcribar/claude/net10-opaque-origin-frames\nLet pages in opaque-origin sandboxed iframes connect\nMerge pull request #62 from budcribar/claude/net10-embedded-server\nMerge net10 (scroll sync) into claude/net10-embedded-server\nSynchronize primary browser scrolling to read-only mirrors\nEmbeddedRelayWpf: embed wwwroot so a single-file publish works\nEmbeddedRelayWpf: target Windows 10 SDK and show crashes\nCopy RemoteWebViewService.Lib into the Docker build and server CI paths\nSplit RemoteWebViewService into an embeddable library for net10\nGate AgentAdmin starts with AGENT_ADMIN_KEY and guard in-flight starts\nAdd the agent registry (AgentHub / AgentAdmin) to RemoteWebViewService\nAdd in-memory event log provider for GetLoggedEvents on Linux\nAdd Linux container mode with Kestrel TLS/HTTP2 for Railway TCP proxy.\nFail the performance check when the baseline has no samples.\nAdd the net10 intermittent CI failure log.\nAdd the package release workflow for the net10 line.\nRead Chrome output on a dedicated thread before waiting for DevTools.\nFail the module-serving step when either test suite fails.\nPort the Chrome module initializer tests onto net10.\nMeasure TestConnectedEvent from the Connected signal, not the pause.\nCancel the WhenAny delays in the lifecycle tests.\nAssert that ping completed after shutdown.\nUse TheoryData for the file-read failure cases.\n\nFull list: https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView/compare/10.0.13...66928b247e28dcae5b286883f208c8ae202ed973",
